  "summary_zh": "這是一個 2025-10 新開的溫泉，設備非常新，景觀也不錯，又在金圈裡面一個非常好的位置。\n\n特色包括雙層溫泉池、瀑布、洞穴區、森林池、無邊際池、冷水池、桑拿與池中酒吧。水溫約 38–40°C。\n\n想泡溫泉，你的旅程又有空檔，可以來這裡體驗，建議保留 2 小時比較充足的體驗。",
  "summary_en": "This newly opened geothermal lagoon (2025‑10) offers modern facilities and great scenery in a prime location within the Golden Circle. It features a double‑level hot‑water pool, waterfall, cave area, forest pool, infinity pool, cold‑water pool, sauna, and a poolside bar, with water temperatures around 38–40 °C. Free parking and restrooms are available on site. We recommend allowing about 2 hours (120 minutes) to fully enjoy the experience.",
